WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.736 --> 00:00:01.832
- [Voiceover] In a city infested with

00:00:01.832 --> 00:00:05.231
crime, disorder, and
chaos, there's one group

00:00:05.231 --> 00:00:07.354
dedicated to upholding justice.

00:00:07.354 --> 00:00:10.983
The Fair Use Friends!

00:00:10.983 --> 00:00:14.973
A crime fighting team of
vaguely familiar superheroes.

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:17.263
There's Superbman!

00:00:17.263 --> 00:00:18.577
- I'm from another planet!

00:00:18.577 --> 00:00:20.095
But not Krypton!

00:00:20.095 --> 00:00:21.825
- [Voiceover] Wunder Woman!

00:00:21.825 --> 00:00:22.854
- Nein!

00:00:22.854 --> 00:00:23.818
- [Voiceover] She's German.

00:00:23.818 --> 00:00:25.268
Man-Spider!

00:00:25.268 --> 00:00:27.411
An ordinary spider bitten
by a radioactive man.

00:00:27.411 --> 00:00:29.714
- My human sense is tingling.

00:00:29.714 --> 00:00:30.952
- [Voiceover] Aquamen!

00:00:32.482 --> 00:00:34.043
And Batman!

00:00:34.043 --> 00:00:35.543
Vampire Batman!

00:00:35.543 --> 00:00:37.352
So look out evil-doers!

00:00:37.352 --> 00:00:40.739
Because the Fair Use Friends
are ready for action!

00:00:40.739 --> 00:00:42.297
The Fair Use Friends are facing

00:00:42.297 --> 00:00:43.748
many copyright infringement lawsuits

00:00:43.748 --> 00:00:45.291
and are technically not ready for action.

00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:47.294
- I thought we had this taken care of!

00:00:47.294 --> 00:00:50.495
- [Voiceover] To be continued!

00:00:50.495 --> 00:00:52.002
We're going to see.

